From 09fce44cd753482a6d23dde99e8aa86d75ccdd44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: perforationbot <perforationbot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:05:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add OpenAI GPT Transcribe speech provider

Add an experimental cloud recognizer that sends one complete recording to
OpenAI's /v1/audio/transcriptions endpoint with gpt-transcribe. It resolves
OPENAI_API_KEY per request through the credentials service, bounds audio,
response bytes and deadline, honors cancellation, and maps failures to typed
categories.

Register it beside the local SenseVoice provider in the voice input bundle
while keeping SenseVoice as the default. Update the bilingual package docs,
subsystem and capability-seam references, generated catalog artifacts, bundle
locales, affected UI goldens, and tests.
